# ReliefMesh needs NO secrets and NO environment variables to build, run or demo.
#
# There is no backend. LLM credentials are entered by each visitor in the browser, in the
# official runtime's "AI model settings" panel, and are stored only in that browser.
# Never put a provider key in this file, in any site folder or in a published JSON file.
#
# The variables below are optional and only affect development tooling.

# Base URL of ReliefMesh Command for the browser tests (default http://localhost:8080).
# RELIEFMESH_COMMAND=http://localhost:8080

# Browser channel for the Playwright tests: "chrome" (default) or "msedge".
# The tests use an installed browser, so nothing is downloaded.
# PW_CHANNEL=chrome

# Where the official agentify-website skill is, for the Inspector CLI's official check.
# In this repository it is found automatically under vendor/agentify-website.
# AGENTIFY_SKILL_DIR=/path/to/agentic-web/skills/agentify-website
